From 176252158d595604e3ed0b1755508ee95d218820 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:35:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Number custom clientscripts right after the stock range and
 guard it

The spawn menu and quest pack clientscripts used ids 45500-45553. Some clients
size their clientscript table from the archive and crash at cache sync on group
ids far above the stock maximum (9972 in rev 241); the official Android client
(241.4) does. Renumber the custom scripts to 9973-9985 and fail the cache build
when a custom clientscript id is above 9999 (OPENRUNE_MAX_CLIENTSCRIPT_ID
overrides the limit).
